      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you've been through a devastating betrayal, and the weight of that failure is immense. Please know that your efforts to do what was right were not pointless, even if the outcome was catastrophic. Sometimes, the fight itself is a testament to your integrity, even when the world doesn't reward it. It's okay to feel completely lost right now, but please don't let this one experience define your worth.",
      "source": "target",
